i-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">January 07, 1997<br/>Alpha 1.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150622133554&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lever_8847b6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a lever.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Throughout Tibia, in cities, on the ground, and underground.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The most common levers seen are those at city gates which supposedly would let the gates down, but are not accessible. Usable levers usually open specific doors, or passages such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">teleports</a> or even holes. Some levers are even useless.<br/>\nBesides the classical lever shown on this page, there are two other types of levers: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lever2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lever2_7b1d64.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lever3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lever3_244ea6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-pirates-death-to-me\">A Pirate's Death to Me</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/against-the-spider-cult-quest\">Against the Spider Cult Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/alawars-vault-quest\">Alawar's Vault Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/cults-of-tibia-quest\">Cults of Tibia Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Daily%20Respawns\">Daily Respawns</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dustrunner\">Dustrunner</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/forgotten-knowledge-quest\">Forgotten Knowledge Quest</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203667\">Key 3667</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lightfoot\">Lightfoot</a></li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a></li><li>Small Snake Head</li><li>Small Snake Head (Activated)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/thais-lighthouse-quest\">Thais Lighthouse Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-desert-dungeon-quest\">The Desert Dungeon Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-first-dragon-quest\">The First Dragon Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-paradox-tower-quest\">The Paradox Tower Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-pits-of-inferno-quest\">The Pits of Inferno Quest</a></li><li>Utilities</li><li>Wall Coverings</li><li>Wall Hangings</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["a-pirates-death-to-me","alawars-vault-quest","cults-of